[text] Phase 2b.1 approval written. The wrapper will pick up `artifacts/phase-approval.json` for commit. All gates passed:

- **Tests**: 130/130 (was 105; +25 new — 9 wire, 15 peer including a race regression, 1 settings).
- **Lint + tsc + build clean.** Bundle 349.8 KB JS / 107.6 KB gzip (+2.3 KB gzip vs Phase 5; budget +20).
